    id: 'afrofuture-dogon-star-tracker',
    title: 'Dogon-Inspired Star-Tracker Attitude Reference',
    tagline: 'Sirius and Canopus give a real attitude fix — and the cultural claim is labelled honestly.',
    category: 'afrofuture',
